  "instructions": [
    "Heat a bamboo steamer base with 2 cups of water over high heat.",
    "Prepare the tiger prawns by removing the shells and deveining them.",
    "In a large bowl, mix together the saffron rice, onion, garlic, mustard seeds, paprika, chili flakes, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Add the mantecare, lemon juice, and olive oil to the bowl and mix well.",
    "Add the rice mixture to the bamboo steamer baskets and steam for 10-12 minutes or until the rice is cooked through.",
    "Add the tiger prawns to the bamboo steamer baskets and steam for an additional 2-3 minutes or until pink and cooked through.",
    "Serve the paella hot, garnished with chopped fresh parsley.",
    "Let the paella rest for 5 minutes before serving to allow the flavors to meld together.",
    "Reheat the paella in the bamboo steamer base if necessary.",
    "Serve immediately and enjoy!"
  ],
